optional_default_uses_earlier_argument.fl:
  before Simplify (200 steps): returns [0: 5; 20; 3; 4; 40]
  after Simplify (123 steps): returns [0: 5; 20; 3; 4; 40]
  the check of kinds: passes before, passes after
